Package: EasyRNASeq
Title: A GUI Platform for RNA-seq Analysis
Version: 4.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Masakazu",
           family = "Hasegawa",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "amufaamo@gmail.com")
Description: A Shiny application enabling wet-lab researchers to perform
    RNA-seq analysis—from count matrix to publication-ready figures—through
    a graphical interface. Key features include journal-ready figure export
    (Nature/Cell/Science presets), asynchronous computation via ExtendedTask,
    Nextflow pipeline integration, reproducible R script output, and
    colorblind-safe defaults (Okabe-Ito palette).
